
@startuml
title TaskManager Sequence Diagram

participant "Client Thread" as Client
participant "TaskManager Execution Thread" as TaskManager
participant "TaskManager Queue" as Queue
participant "Task Execution Thread" as TaskExecution

== Client Invokes start() ==

Client -> TaskManager: start()
note right of TaskManager: Created via runAsync()\n(from workflowServices.getExecutor())
TaskManager -> TaskManager: submissionQueue.take()\n(waiting for tasks)

note over TaskManager: ...\n(polling multiple times)\n...

== Task Submission ==

Client -> Queue: execute(workflowId, action, payload)
Queue --> Client: CompletableFuture<Map>

TaskManager -> TaskManager: submissionQueue.take()\n(task found)
TaskManager -> TaskManager: CompletableFuture.supplyAsync\n(offload to executor)

create TaskExecution
TaskManager -> TaskExecution: Created via supplyAsync()\n(from workflowServices.getExecutor())
TaskExecution -> TaskExecution: Execute user action\n(PayloadProcessor)
TaskExecution -> TaskExecution: Process result\nand complete future

TaskExecution --> Client: Future completed
TaskManager -> TaskManager: submissionQueue.take()\n(waiting for more tasks)

== Shutdown ==

Client -> TaskManager: shutdown()
TaskManager -> TaskManager: running.set(false)
TaskManager -> TaskManager: Cancel execution future
destroy TaskManager
note over TaskManager: Thread terminated

@enduml